# Keep the Docker build context small. The Dockerfiles copy the manifests and
# source they need explicitly, so everything below is build-irrelevant noise.

# Dependencies and build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.quasar
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS, CI, tooling metadata
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode

# Deploy/infra and docs not needed to build an image
infra
wiki
scripts
README.md
*.md

# Local env and logs
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log

# OS cruft
**/.DS_Store
